    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No eye swelling, watering, or vision change</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Smell improving; nose clear most days; a little crusting in the morning; no nosebleeds or ear symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache or clear watery drainage on bending forward</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

